  "description": "Unbeknownst to them, Min and Hyunwoo have been in one another's life since they were little. Min is a TV producer who has been demoted to the entertainment division for defending his colleague. Hyunwoo is a K-pop idol who has fallen from grace after his controversy over an assault against a fellow idol. The two lost souls develop feelings for each other while producing a variety show.\n\n(Source: NETCOMICS)",
